WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:28.387
"We're here," Dipper said.

2
00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:35.398
"Tire Town Old Cars' Home."

3
00:00:35.399 --> 00:00:37.838
It was Saturday.

4
00:00:37.839 --> 00:00:42.162
The friends were meeting Dipper's grandma.

5
00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:50.195
"This place is nice," Eddy said.

6
00:00:50.196 --> 00:00:54.575
"I see a garden," Poppy said.

7
00:00:54.576 --> 00:00:58.963
Jeb looked around.

8
00:00:58.964 --> 00:01:02.515
"Does this place have dirt?" he asked.

9
00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:06.112
"Nope," Dipper said.

10
00:01:06.113 --> 00:01:08.928
"Older cars don't like dirt."

11
00:01:08.936 --> 00:01:12.704
"I don't see any piles," said Gasser.

12
00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:18.122
"There's nothing to jump over."

13
00:01:18.122 --> 00:01:21.499
"Of course not," Dipper said.

14
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.535
"Older cars don't jump over piles."

15
00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:29.786
Some cars and trucks drove over.

16
00:01:29.786 --> 00:01:34.140
"Dipper!" said an ice cream truck.

17
00:01:34.141 --> 00:01:37.168
"Hi, Grandma!" Dipper said.

18
00:01:37.169 --> 00:01:40.499
"These are my friends."

19
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:51.831
The older cars smiled at Eddy.

20
00:01:51.832 --> 00:01:55.101
They smiled at Poppy and Jeb.

21
00:01:55.102 --> 00:02:01.087
But then the cars saw Gasser.

22
00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:06.613
"Oh no!" one car said.

23
00:02:06.613 --> 00:02:11.379
"That truck is scary!"
